=== H5 (v2/P2): 内容显著性门控 vs 长上下文压缩（匹配存储预算, LoCoMo）===
corpus        : /tmp/locomo10.json
conversations : 10
budgets       : 10%, 25%, 50%, 100%
topK          : 4
metric        : evidenceRecall@4 (src/locomo) + token-F1 (src/sim) [FULL set]
ours gate     : DEFAULT_GATING {"kSalience":0.8,"kSocial":0.5,"kNovelty":0.3}
baselines     : extractive-compression (centroid+salience, PRIM) + recency window (SECONDARY) + random (5 seeds)

--- (B) answer-correctness layer: sampled LLM generation via local qwythos ---
  answer budget     : 25% (memory-constrained)
  sample/conversation: 3 (~30 total)
  model             : qwythos:latest @ http://localhost:11434/api/generate

